{"parse": {"title": "AGD-03", "pageid": 22998, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AGD-02\" title=\"AGD-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AGD-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/AGD-04\" title=\"AGD-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AGD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A4.BA.E5.AE.9D.E5.8E.86.E9.99.A9.E8.AE.B0\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"夺宝历险记\">夺宝历险记</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 夺宝历险记</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Adventures</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>钻<span class=\"color-value\"></span>入<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>个<span class=\"color-value\"></span>树<span class=\"color-value\"></span>洞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>偷<span class=\"color-value\"></span>摸<span class=\"color-value\"></span>进<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>黑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>夜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跑<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叫<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>想<span class=\"color-value\"></span>跳<span class=\"color-value\"></span>得<span class=\"color-value\"></span>更<span class=\"color-value\"></span>高<span class=\"color-value\"></span>！<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190403</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>亲爱的哈拉尔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>大人们常说，火炬会熄灭，巨树会枯萎，就连彻夜不眠的盛宴，也迟早只会留下一片杯盘狼藉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>“英雄也总会有落幕的时候”，他们一本正经，煞有介事，屁股压住遥控器都不肯挪一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>大人摆出一副什么都懂的样子，像一位君王对孩子发号施令，可实际上呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>他们可能也只不过是在那扇，通往荣誉与骄傲的门扉前，偷偷瞥过一眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">他们说——别爬太高。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你们这些家伙，快给我从树上下来。<br />不然，我就要……让你们摔跟头了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>在抓住那个“呼玛鸟”之前，我们绝不会下来！<br />等到了黄昏，它一定会出现的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>据说只要喂它们吃泡了3天的臭皮靴和脚趾甲，就能获得一个愿望。我要让它们吃掉所有的试卷，这样我们就不用考试了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div>我，我要让它找到被教员丢掉的书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304122.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304122.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-304122.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304122.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>可恶，你们这帮小捣蛋鬼。<br />我要爬上去了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>不不，别上来！这棵树不能再——<br />啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲＆金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>啊——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">他们说——别想太多。</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"jijinhuikefang\"><img alt=\"jijinhuikefang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/600px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/900px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-jijinhuikefang.png/1200px-Cg-jijinhuikefang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305812.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-305812.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305812.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305812.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-305812.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305812.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-305812.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305812.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>……真的会有幽灵过来吗？我已经有点儿发困了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div>一定会有的！他们说，那个失踪学生的鬼魂，在每个满月的夜晚，就会出现在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>而只要找到他，就能知道下次考试的题目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>好吧，我先趴在地上睡会儿，等他——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-561710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-561710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/HeadIconSmall-561710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>噗呲噗呲，瞧！<br />“幽灵”来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>今天的月亮正好～♫<br />哼哼，接下来拿出我的占卜水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嗯？是谁在那儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>啊——！<br />快走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">他们说——别跑太快。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>在这堂课中，你们将会学到如何应对“格拉瓦库斯”。<br />接下来我将放出人工圈养的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>啊啊啊——我的披风！<br />船员们，快点帮我把它给拦住！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-561801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-561801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/HeadIconSmall-561801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格拉瓦库斯：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:122%\">嗷嗷嗷！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">领主</span>，<span style=\"font-size:122%\">快停</span>下来——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:138%\">它</span><span style=\"font-size:122%\">喜欢响声大</span>，跑得快的——<span style=\"font-size:83%\">东西！</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305811.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305811.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-305811.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305811.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:122%\">我听——不——见！</span></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>“别爬太高，别想太多，别跑太快，别太自我，别走太远，别去……冒险！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>要是都听这些大人的话，那些珍奇的财宝，那些了不起的壮举，那些数不胜数的英雄事迹，都该像他们屁股底下的遥控器，掉进任谁都找不见的沙发缝里了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>所以，亲爱的哈拉尔——在第一防线学校，我召集了一帮能力出众的船员，一起反抗那些无聊的大人。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaozoulang\"><img alt=\"xuexiaozoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>他们忠心耿耿，为我鞠躬尽瘁。<br />面对凶狠的女巫，面不改色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>我发誓，是我一个人把所有的炸鱼薯条都偷来吃了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div>噗呲、噗呲……领主，你的嘴角。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>噢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>他们拥有密米尔的智慧、索尔的机敏。<br />最狡猾的女巫对此也束手无策。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嘿，你口袋里鼓起来的是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>呃，是、是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e6/HeadIconSmall-561510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div>——是我送给她的熏臭嚼嚼块！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/HeadIconSmall-561501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃菲：</div><div>你不会想用手掏出来的，她会让你恶心得一整晚都吃不下饭！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嗅、嗅……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>即便在千钧一发之际——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-561701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金钥匙桑丘：</div><div>嘿——嘿！那不是十四行诗女士吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>嗯？什，什么？！她，她或许正需要一名优秀的纪律辅员的帮助！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304117.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304117.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我，我待会儿就回来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">信纸：</div><div>我和我的船员也总能逃出生天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_guanjiaosushe_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“不得不说，我的心激动得都要蹦出来啦！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“亲爱的哈拉尔，我已经等不及让你看到我在这里荣获的一切。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“另外，我在静水湖的船员们都还好吗？‘蠢牛霍华德’有没有把公园的空地抢走？老约翰发现我贴在他车屁股后边的纸条了吗？哈哈哈，他肯定气得够呛……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“还有，我收到了你送来的嚼嚼糖，我的船员们可是爱死它了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“另外，你的字怎么比之前看起来好了那么多？是邻居的西格莉德阿姨在替你写信吗？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-305810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-305810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-305810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“哈，你果然被她给迷糊住了！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“总之，希望你在那边一切都好。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“那么，我先睡啦！那本像石头一样重的《炼金术概论》，把我弄得头晕脑胀。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-305801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃里克：</div><div>“——想你的埃里克。”</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AGD-03"}}